        require(depositAmount > c.MinDeposit(), "deposit must exceed minimum");

        uint beforeBalance = c.balances(address(this));

        c.Deposit{value: depositAmount}();

        uint afterBalance = c.balances(address(this));

        assert(afterBalance == beforeBalance + depositAmount);
    }

    receive() external payable {}
}

